## LOT Lifecycle · QR (Blueprint 연계)

- **Traceability QR:** 1 LOT = 1 QR · Scan → **LOT Lifecycle** (문서 ❌)
- **QR ID:** `QR-2026-000001` (design-only · `TITAN_QR_ID_POLICY`)
- **QR Version:** V1 → 재발행 → V2 · 재출력 = 기존 Version (`TITAN_QR_VERSION_POLICY`)
- **조회 권한:** admin · internal · customer (`TITAN_QR_LOOKUP_PERMISSIONS`)

